**# The {{M|current health}} to {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} on the affected enemy target.
**# The {{M|movement speed}} slow {{M|debuff}}.
**# {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|huskar_life_break_[[taunt]]}}
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**# The {{M|current health}} to {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage|text=self-spell damage|x}}.
**# Huskar is given an attack order on the affected enemy unit, regardless of auto-attack settings.

* Grants the following bonuses while leaping, excluding {{A|Huskar|Berserker's Blood}}'s bonus values:
** Has {{Code|{{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1-v1)|v1={{#var:Life Break type1 value3}}|%}} + {{calc|(1-v1)*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}|v1={{#var:Life Break type1 value3}}|%}} × Σ[[Intelligence|Int]]}} {{M|magic resistance}} per stack.

