{{Debuffnotes
| name = Inner Fire
| desc = The {{M|forced movement}} applied no longer affects the [[debuff immune]] enemy unit.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|huskar_inner_fire_[[knockback]]}}
**#* All the ability's negative effects are applied in one single debuff instance.
**#** {{M|Silence}}
**#** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Knockback|Out}}
**#*** Applies a non-disabling knockback on all affected enemy units, pushing them to a fixed {{#var:Inner Fire value3}}-distance from point [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] , within the centerpoint of the {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} area-targeted location, over {{#var:Inner Fire type1 value3}} ‒ {{#var:Inner Fire type1 value4}} seconds.
**#**** Hence the min and max knockback speed are {{#expr:{{#var:Inner Fire type1 value1}}/{{#var:Inner Fire type1 value3}}}} ‒ {{#expr:{{#var:Inner Fire type1 value2}}/{{#var:Inner Fire type1 value4}}}} correspondingly to the min and max knockback distance.
**#**** The knockback duration varies depending on the terrain.
**#**** Can push enemy units over {{M|impassable terrain}}.
**#** Cancels most position-changing effects on the x-axis, but not z-axis movement.
**#* {{Symbol|Trees}}
**#** [[Trees]] within {{#var:Inner Fire basic1}}-radius of the pushed unit are destroyed upon contact.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Inner Fire icon0}}
| desc = In a fiery rage, knocks all nearby enemies away from you to a fixed distance, dealing damage and silencing them.
}}

