{{Illusionnotes
| name = Burning Spear
| desc = Neither functional nor is [[toggled]] {{Symbol|Toggle|On}}.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Burning Spear
| desc = Cannot acquire active {{M|attack modifiers}}.
| structure = hidden
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Burning Spear
| desc = Utilizes the caster's current {{M|attack range}} while {{M|Autocast}} is active, manual cast utilizes the ability's current {{M|cast range}}.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Burning Spear is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
** Has a different cast range when casting Burning Spear manually; {{M|Autocast}} uses Huskar's current {{M|attack range|x}}.
*** Has Autocast off by default.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** This ability component can be applied by other [[instant attack]] sources.

* Cannot be cast on the following units:
** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
** {{M|Buildings}}
** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** The {{M|current health}} cost utilizes [[setting health]] and is non-lethal.
** Hence, this ability can be cast when Huskar has less than the required health.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# Applies two debuffs on the affected enemy unit per attack:
**#* [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|huskar_burning_spear_counter}}
**#** This debuff indicates the number of stacks visible to everyone.
**#** Reapplying this debuff refreshes the duration.
**#* [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|huskar_burning_spear_debuff}}
**#** Applies the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} correspondingly to the current stacks, then deals damage in 1-second intervals, 1 second upon debuff application. This is defined as:
**#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Spell Damage|SpellDmg]] × Stacks}}
**#*** The damage value is determined by the current ability level upon debuff application.
**#*** Hence, reapplying this debuff do not update to the current damage values.
**# Huskar's attack instance.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Burning Spear icon0}}
| desc = Huskar sets his spears aflame, dealing damage over time with his regular attack.  Multiple attacks will stack additional damage.  Each attack drains some of Huskar's health.
}}

