fields.value:
{{Illusionnotes
| name = Berserker's Blood
| desc = Cannot utilize the {{M|magic resistance}} component by design.<br><br>Other ability components are fully functional.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Berserker's Blood icon0}}
| desc = Huskar's injuries feed his power, giving increased attack speed, magic resistance and health regen based on missing health. Health regen is a percentage of your strength.
}}
* Has a [[Wikipedia:Factorization#Polynomials|polynomial factor]] of {{#var:Berserker's Blood basic1}} and is defined as:
** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|TraitBonus Value {{=}} (((1 - %[[Health|CurrentHP]]) / {{#expr:1-{{#var:Berserker's Blood basic2}}}}) ^ {{#var:Berserker's Blood basic1}}) × MAX TraitBonus}}

* Grants up to {{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1-v1)|v1={{#var:Berserker's Blood value3}}|%}} {{M|magic resistance}} per {{M|current health}} percentage missing.
** Berserker's Blood increases the total {{M|magic resistance|x}} by {{calc|(1-v1)*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}*10|v1={{#var:Berserker's Blood value3}}|%}} per 10 {{M|intelligence}} points.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** Applies the following ability effects to Huskar's model:
*** The greater the {{M|current health}} percentage loss, the straighter Huskar stands, the darker the color of his hero model.
*** {{Symbol|Model Size}}
**** Increases his [[model size]] by 1% linearly per {{Code|2.5%}} max health missing, and is defined as:
***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Current[[Health|HP]] ≥ 97.5% MaxHP , ModelSizeBonus {{=}} nil}}
***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|CurrentHP ≤ 2.5% MaxHP , MAX ModelSizeBonus {{=}} 39%}}

